<title>USA: Kennedy-Wilson buys back shares.</title>
<headline>Kennedy-Wilson buys back shares.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kennedy-Wilson Inc said it acquired 12,500 shares of its outstanding common stock at $8.50 a share.</p>
</text>
